                        "review": "Spread your wings and fly like a... erm.. brick*.\nBits of the menu fall right outside of my field of view.\nThere is no turning or banking during flight.\nWant to change direction? Turn around or give your chair a good swing.\nThis completely kills any feeling of immersion or flying.\nYour graphics card better have a turbo charged setting (with cupholders) or drawing of terrain will follow after you have flow... sorry hurtled over the bit of terrain that you are at.\nThis still needs work.\nMind you, the idea is nice.\n",
